{"4609190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cats and Sushi", "steam_appid": 4609190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cats and Sushi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0f9de1f6745289b18c4802a0de0ab7be.poster.avif?t=1787118809\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0f9de1f6745289b18c4802a0de0ab7be.webm?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0f9de1f6745289b18c4802a0de0ab7be.mp4?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where we serve the best sushi around the town to our adorable cat customers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your day begins with stocking up the ingredients for the upcoming day and adjust prices for the dishes if necessary.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0716877ff86ad61814592eb9afa63df8.poster.avif?t=1787118809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0716877ff86ad61814592eb9afa63df8.webm?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0716877ff86ad61814592eb9afa63df8.mp4?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare dishes requested by the customers and they are served on a conveyor belt.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get extra tips for fast delivery and following recipes accurately.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the day, earn enough to atleast pay the rent for next day and survive for as long as possible.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 10+ dishes in this fast paced endless survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/4369e34b4e9bcff60ed2c0cb9624428a.poster.avif?t=1787118809\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/4369e34b4e9bcff60ed2c0cb9624428a.webm?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/4369e34b4e9bcff60ed2c0cb9624428a.mp4?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cats and Sushi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0f9de1f6745289b18c4802a0de0ab7be.poster.avif?t=1787118809\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0f9de1f6745289b18c4802a0de0ab7be.webm?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609190/extras/0f9de1f6745289b18c4802a0de0ab7be.mp4?t=1787118809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where we serve the best sushi around the town to our adorable cat customers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>